    blurb_en: 'Swap two supply phases and the field turns the other way, while a cyclic shift of all three does not. Try every row of the six-way permutation table, then press forward and reverse on the power circuit with KM1 and KM2 and see that with both contactors closed L1 and L3 are shorted and Q1 trips.',
